  <string name="6rc7w3nopcqv2-n42_sblx" mz="n42">Combat tutorial
1. Combat is card based. Each unit takes turns until one side wins.
2. Everyone shares one deck and draws 2 cards from it each turn. The player also draws 1 extra card from their personal deck.
3. Cards are divided into Base cards, Skill cards, and Item cards.
[Base Cards]: You may use 1 [Attack] each turn. If the target cannot play 1 [Dodge], they take 1 damage. [Heal] restores 1 HP.
[Skill Cards]: After being played, they resolve according to their description. There is no use limit.
[Item Cards]: After being played, they enter your item area. You may have at most 1 weapon and 1 armor.
</string>
