  <string name="6rc7w3no82hnm-n12_tqhu" mz="n12">Welcome to the Godslayer's Road. You are one who dares to challenge a god.
The god waits in the temple at the mountain summit. You must pass through the mountain base, the mountainside, and the summit before you can defeat him.
This is the mountain base map. This place has not yet fully fallen under the god's control.

You may explore the mountain base in any order.         and           mean you will encounter combat. Combat rewards you with cards in normal battles and skills in elite battles.

            means you will encounter an event. Events usually ask you to make a choice.
However, both combat and events increase the Fog inside you by 1. At the mountain base, you can only absorb up to 9 Fog.
You have two campfires on the mountain base map. You may stop and use a campfire to rest. These campfires will disappear on the next map.
At the top of the map waits the guardian at the end of the mountain base, the boss of this area. Defeat him to reach the mountainside, but you may want to grow stronger through easier battles first.</string>
