  <string name="6rc7w3nohprj2c-n6_gqgq" mz="n6">This is the mountainside map.
You must climb from the bottom to the top.
The map is an upward path with branching routes. Each exploration still increases Fog by 1. The Fog grows thicker here, and there is no turning back.
Defeat the guardian at the peak of the mountainside to reach the summit.</string>
